{"seq":1,"slug":"vega-gamma-hedging","title":"波动率对冲实务：vega、gamma 与 vanna-volga 组合对冲","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/volatility-surface-exotic-market-making/hedging-risk-compliance/vega-gamma-hedging","wordCount":2793,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"波动率对冲实务-vega-gamma-与-vanna-volga-组合对冲\">波动率对冲实务：vega、gamma 与 vanna-volga 组合对冲</h1><p>做市台的 vega 风险不是一条数字，而是一张按到期与执行价铺开的<strong>矩阵</strong>。报价引擎把奇异期权的中间价与价差算出来之后（见 <a href=\"../market-making-engine-quoting/quoting-engine-architecture\">报价引擎架构：从曲面到报价</a>），台上面对的是一张带有大量零的 vega 格子表：奇异品把风险堆在少数几个节点上，香草品则铺满整张网格。对冲要做的，是把这张矩阵压成一个可执行、可核算、可向风控交代的<strong>香草组合 + 现货头寸</strong>。本文讲这件事在 2026 年真实台上的做法：分桶、组合对冲的目标函数、vanna-volga 为什么能减少对冲工具数、成本与约束怎么进目标、以及盘后怎么向监管口径（ISDA SIMM、Basel FRTB）交账。</p>\n<p>需要先划清一条边界：希腊字母本身的<strong>定义与分解</strong>——Vega、Vanna、Volga 分别是什么、奇异品为何在障碍附近 Delta 跳变——属于上一篇 <a href=\"../exotic-pricing-greeks/exotic-greeks-vanna-volga\">奇异期权希腊字母与 Vanna-Volga 风险分解</a> 的范围。本文不重复定义，只处理&quot;这些暴露摆在台上之后，用什么工具、按什么目标、受什么约束去压平&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-分桶-期限匹配与-dollar-vega-归一化\">核心概念：分桶、期限匹配与 dollar-vega 归一化</h2><p>对冲的第一步不是挑工具，是<strong>把风险归一化到可比较的单位</strong>。同一笔 1 年期期权的 vega 按 Black-Scholes 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>σ</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><msqrt><mi>T</mi></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_\\sigma = S\\sqrt{T}\\,\\phi(d_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1767em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，对同一条波动率曲线的平行冲击，不同到期、不同执行价的头寸 vega 数量级相差数倍。若直接对原始 vega 求和，短端会淹没长端，台上会误以为风险很小。</p>\n<p>实务用 <strong>dollar-vega（或 vega-notional 归一）</strong>：把每个节点的 vega 乘上它对 1 个波动率点（1 vol point = 1%）变动的美元价值，再按标准到期桶归并。FX 台常用的桶是 1 周、1 月、3 月、6 月、1 年、2 年——这套分桶不是随意定的，它与 ISDA SIMM 对 GIR 与 FX 波动率风险的期限桶划分一致，因此台上的内部风险视图可以较自然地映射到日终保证金计算。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类型</th>\n<th>敏感度定义</th>\n<th>典型对冲工具</th>\n<th>主要约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Delta</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial V/\\partial S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>现货 / 远汇 / 期货</td>\n<td>交易成本最低，可高频调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gamma</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial^2 V/\\partial S^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>近月 ATM 香草跨式</td>\n<td>用期权引起更多 vega 与成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vega（平行）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial V/\\partial \\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>各桶 ATM 香草</td>\n<td>期限桶不能错配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vanna</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial^2 V/\\partial S\\,\\partial\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>25-delta 风险逆转组合</td>\n<td>需两侧流动性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Volga</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\partial^2 V/\\partial \\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>25-delta 蝶式组合</td>\n<td>翼部价差通常最宽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个常被新手忽略的点：<strong>vega 的期限桶必须分桶对冲，不能只看总量</strong>。一笔 1 年期障碍期权能被一组 3 月 + 1 年香草对冲掉平行 vega，但剩下的日历（term-structure）风险会在曲面斜率移动时暴露——这正是本章用限额管住的第一类风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合对冲-把稀疏风险写成最小二乘问题\">组合对冲：把稀疏风险写成最小二乘问题</h2><p>设台上持有的奇异与香草头寸的总暴露向量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\in \\mathbb{R}^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（按分桶后的敏感度节点排列），可供选择的香草对冲工具集为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（每列是一个工具在各节点上的敏感度）。对冲的目标是找权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\in \\mathbb{R}^m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，使剩余暴露 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b - Ax</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 尽量小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></munder><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∥</mo><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{x}\\ \\lVert b - Ax \\rVert_2^2 + \\lambda\\, c(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.45em;vertical-align:-0.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">∥</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>无约束时解是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>A</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^* = (A^\\top A)^{-1} A^\\top b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，即把奇异风险投影到香草敏感度张成的空间上。这就是&quot;用香草组合复制奇异风险&quot;的代数形式，也正是 Vanna-Volga 方法的底层逻辑——只不过 VV 把工具集固定为 3 个（ATM、25d RR、25d BF），因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，求解退化成闭式的三个权重。</p>\n<p>Vanna-Volga 的价格修正项权重（推导见上一篇）在<strong>对冲</strong>视角下有一个更直白的经济含义：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Vanna</mtext><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>Vanna</mtext><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mtext>Volga</mtext><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mtext>Volga</mtext><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{RR} = \\frac{\\text{Vanna}_{exotic}}{\\text{Vanna}_{RR}}, \\qquad x_{BF} = \\frac{\\text{Volga}_{exotic}}{\\text{Volga}_{BF}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Vanna</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Vanna</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3016em;vertical-align:-0.9301em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Volga</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Volga</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9301em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，奇异期权的 vanna 由风险逆转对冲、volga 由蝶式对冲，剩下的平行 vega 交给 ATM。台上实际执行时，这三个权重同时是<strong>报价价差的来源</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的绝对值乘上对应工具的买卖价差，再加上模型风险缓冲，得到奇异品的 vanna-volga 价差（VV spread）。这与报价引擎里的价差构造共用同一套系数——换句话说，对冲组合的选择直接决定了台上收多少。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[奇异期权风险桶] --&gt; B[平行 vega]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Vanna 交叉项]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Volga 凸性项]&#10;    A --&gt; E[剩余 Gamma]&#10;    B --&gt; F[ATM 香草 按桶]&#10;    C --&gt; G[25d RR 组合]&#10;    D --&gt; H[25d BF 组合]&#10;    E --&gt; I[近月跨式]&#10;    F --&gt; J[组合权重 x*]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[残差 = 未对冲风险]&#10;    K --&gt; L[进限额与缓冲]&#10;    L --&gt; M[反哺报价价差]\">graph TD\n    A[奇异期权风险桶] --&gt; B[平行 vega]\n    A --&gt; C[Vanna 交叉项]\n    A --&gt; D[Volga 凸性项]\n    A --&gt; E[剩余 Gamma]\n    B --&gt; F[ATM 香草 按桶]\n    C --&gt; G[25d RR 组合]\n    D --&gt; H[25d BF 组合]\n    E --&gt; I[近月跨式]\n    F --&gt; J[组合权重 x*]\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[残差 = 未对冲风险]\n    K --&gt; L[进限额与缓冲]\n    L --&gt; M[反哺报价价差]</pre><p>工具集的<strong>选择</strong>（哪些列进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>）比求解本身更重要。列太多会让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A^\\top A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 病态、权重在相近工具间来回跳（实务称为对冲不稳定）；列太少则残差系统性地留在某一节点。常见做法是限定每个期限桶只用 ATM + 两侧 25-delta（或在翼部流动性不足时用 10-delta），并给权重加正则项防止极端解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本-流动性与约束下的稳健对冲\">成本、流动性与约束下的稳健对冲</h2><p>理论上的最小二乘解在真实台上不可执行，因为它忽略了<strong>调仓成本与流动性</strong>。两个修正决定了实务与教科书的差距：</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>成本项</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 解出的组合往往需要卖出大量 25-delta 翼部，而翼部的买卖价差最宽。把成本写成换手惩罚——每次调仓的美元成本近似为工具名义乘以其买卖价差——台上会在&quot;多对冲一点残差&quot;与&quot;多付一点价差&quot;之间取舍。典型结论是：<strong>只在残差超过某个阈值时才调仓</strong>，用小额、高频的现货对冲处理 Delta（成本无限小），用低频、精准的期权对冲处理 vega / vanna / volga（成本高，不宜频繁动）。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>模型风险与凸性上限</strong>。Gamma 对冲用近月 ATM 香草最有效，但这会引入新的 vega；若近月隐含波动率被压低，对冲成本上升，台上会转向用稍远月的跨式。同时，奇异品在障碍附近的负 Gamma 需要<strong>上限控制</strong>：允许一定残差 Gamma 未对冲，把这部分折算进尾风险缓冲，而不是试图逐点抹平（后者会在流动性差的翼部付过高代价）。</p>\n<p>成本和约束如何进入报价，与 <a href=\"../market-making-engine-quoting/spread-inventory-management\">价差与库存管理</a> 里的库存风险模型是同一个框架——对冲残差本质上是一种&quot;被动持有的风险库存&quot;，它占用限额、消耗资本，必须被定价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对冲决策</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n<th>2026 年台上取向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>现货 / 远汇 Delta</td>\n<td>秒级到分钟级</td>\n<td>点差极小</td>\n<td>自动化、无人工干预</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近月 Gamma</td>\n<td>日内数次</td>\n<td>期权价差 + 引入 vega</td>\n<td>阈值触发，非连续</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分桶 Vega</td>\n<td>日频或事件驱动</td>\n<td>香草价差</td>\n<td>与曲面校准同频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vanna / Volga 组合</td>\n<td>日频到周频</td>\n<td>翼部价差最宽</td>\n<td>倾向用 VV 闭式权重一次到位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部残差</td>\n<td>不主动对冲</td>\n<td>占用资本与限额</td>\n<td>计入缓冲，反哺价差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从台上到监管-simm-frtb-与盘中对冲的边界\">从台上到监管：SIMM、FRTB 与盘中对冲的边界</h2><p>台上对冲完并不等于风险记账完成。2026 年的市场结构里，OTC 衍生品保证金普遍按 <strong>ISDA SIMM（Standard Initial Margin Model）</strong> 计算——它把敏感度按风险类别（利率、FX、股票、信用、商品）与期限桶组织，正是上文分桶逻辑的监管镜像。台上内部用的期限桶越接近 SIMM 的桶划分，日终对保证金影响的解释成本越低。</p>\n<p>另一条线是 <strong>Basel FRTB（Fundamental Review of the Trading Book）</strong>。FRTB 的敏感度法（Sensitivity-Based Method, SBM）要求按 delta / vega / curvature 三类敏感度分别计算风险资本，其中 <strong>curvature risk</strong> 明确要求机构用一组指定的压力情景重估期权组合——这与台上有意保留的&quot;未对冲 Gamma 残差&quot;直接相关。也就是说，台上为流动性放弃的那部分凸性对冲，会在 FRTB 的 curvature 口径里以资本占用的形式重新出现，必须计入定价。</p>\n<p>FX 市场还叠了一层行为准则：<strong>FX Global Code</strong>（全球外汇市场准则，由全球外汇委员会 GFXC 维护，2021 年更新）要求做市商在报价、执行与信息披露上遵循既定原则，其中关于 last look 与订单处理的条款直接影响台上用现货对冲 Delta 时的执行方式。</p>\n<p>一个 2026 年的实务边界值得强调：<strong>盘中实时对冲与日终监管敏感度是两套不同频率的视图</strong>。盘中台上的目标是压平实际敞口，用的是内部分桶与工具集；日终风控要交的是 SIMM / FRTB 口径下的敏感度，用的是监管分桶与规定的曲线冲击。两者不是简单换算关系，其中差异（如监管对曲面分层、对基差风险的单独桶）需要在系统层面显式建模，而不能指望&quot;内部对冲好了，监管数字自然就低&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"治理-文档与可复算\">治理、文档与可复算</h2><p>对冲不是一次性动作，而是一个需要留痕的循环。2026 年台上有三条治理要求已成硬约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>假设与参数留痕</strong>：曲面模型（SABR / SVI 等）、校准权重、波动率曲面冲击情景（如 SIMM 规定的相对冲击与曲率冲击）都要版本化，因为对冲权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 依赖它们。</li>\n<li><strong>对冲有效性可复算</strong>：给定同一敞口与工具集，重跑应得到同一组合权重；差异来源（数据切点、校准时点、执行滑点）必须可解释。</li>\n<li><strong>限额与升级路径</strong>：分桶 vega、vanna、volga 各自设限额，触发后按预案减仓或在上限内保留并计入缓冲。限额结构通常直接对接本章后续的资本与合规报告口径。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这三条串起来看，对冲的闭环是：<strong>分解风险（Greeks）→ 组合对冲（最小二乘 / VV 权重）→ 计入成本与约束 → 反哺报价价差 → 向 SIMM / FRTB 交账</strong>。任何一环脱节——例如只对冲平行 vega 而放任 vanna——都会在曲面斜率或凸性移动时以未定价损失的形式暴露。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[持仓] --&gt; B[敏感度分解]&#10;    B --&gt; C[组合对冲求解]&#10;    C --&gt; D[成本与限额约束]&#10;    D --&gt; E[执行调仓]&#10;    E --&gt; F[残差与缓冲]&#10;    F --&gt; G[反哺报价价差]&#10;    F --&gt; H[日终 SIMM / FRTB 敏感度]&#10;    H --&gt; I[保证金与资本]&#10;    G --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[持仓] --&gt; B[敏感度分解]\n    B --&gt; C[组合对冲求解]\n    C --&gt; D[成本与限额约束]\n    D --&gt; E[执行调仓]\n    E --&gt; F[残差与缓冲]\n    F --&gt; G[反哺报价价差]\n    F --&gt; H[日终 SIMM / FRTB 敏感度]\n    H --&gt; I[保证金与资本]\n    G --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>波动率风险必须按<strong>期限桶分桶、用 dollar-vega 归一</strong>后再对冲，直接对原始 vega 求和会误判风险。</li>\n<li>组合对冲是一个<strong>带正则的最小二乘</strong>问题；Vanna-Volga 是工具集固定为 ATM / 25d RR / 25d BF 时的闭式特例，其权重同时决定报价价差。</li>\n<li>真实台的差距在<strong>成本项与约束</strong>：Delta 高频低成本、期权低频高成本，Gamma 残差按流动性权衡后计入缓冲。</li>\n<li>监管口径（ISDA SIMM、Basel FRTB 的 SBM/curvature、FX Global Code）与内部对冲视图<strong>频率与分桶都不同</strong>，需显式建模而非换算。</li>\n<li>对冲闭环的产物是<strong>可复算的组合权重 + 限额占用 + 报价价差</strong>，三者必须一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"波动率对冲实务：vega、gamma 与 vanna-volga 组合对冲","id":"波动率对冲实务-vega-gamma-与-vanna-volga-组合对冲"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分桶、期限匹配与 dollar-vega 归一化","id":"核心概念-分桶-期限匹配与-dollar-vega-归一化"},{"level":2,"text":"组合对冲：把稀疏风险写成最小二乘问题","id":"组合对冲-把稀疏风险写成最小二乘问题"},{"level":2,"text":"成本、流动性与约束下的稳健对冲","id":"成本-流动性与约束下的稳健对冲"},{"level":2,"text":"从台上到监管：SIMM、FRTB 与盘中对冲的边界","id":"从台上到监管-simm-frtb-与盘中对冲的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"治理、文档与可复算","id":"治理-文档与可复算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RFQ 自动化与成交执行：工作流、参考价与拒单处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/volatility-surface-exotic-market-making/market-making-engine-quoting/rfq-automation-execution"},"next":{"title":"准备金、资本占用与模型风险：VA、FRTB 与 SIMM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/volatility-surface-exotic-market-making/hedging-risk-compliance/reserves-capital-model-risk"}}